{"articleNo":"2938","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2938&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"●생활관 입사자 학적부 사진 등재 안내●","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.08.23","hit":"10338","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">생활관 입사자 학적부 사진 등재 안내</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;2011학년도 2학기 생활관을 입사하는 대상자는 학적부 사진이 없으면 관생증 출력이 되지 않아 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">생활관 입사에 제한(식사 등록)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">을 받을 수 있습니다. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">학적부 사진을 아래 방법으로 등재하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">○</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">사진 등재 기한</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"> : 2011. 8. 25(목)까지<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">※ 관생증을 카드 프린터로 출력하므로 기일 엄수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">○</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">원스톱서비스 학적부 사진 등재 방법<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;원스톱 서비스 → 학적부 → 학적부 기재변경 / 사진을 등재 또는 변경</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">○ 호실 배정 공고<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2011. 8. 26(금) 생활관 홈페이지 또는 학교 홈페이지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2011. 8</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;금오공과대학교생활관장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
